The project is named "SylCompilerV2".
Bring in "sys" as sys.
Bring in "math" as math.

Note: Represents a single word or symbol in Syl.
Define an Entity called Token:
    Set kind to "Unknown".
    Set value to "".
    Set line_number to 0.

Note: Reads a raw string and breaks it into Syl Tokens.
Define an action called tokenize taking raw_code:
    Create a List called token_list.
    Print "Lexing source code...".
    
    Note: Future logic for parsing English words natively goes here.
    
    Return token_list.
